BOLTS — fastener dimension tables
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Component:  ISO 4762 / DIN 912 socket-head cap screw dimensions
            (src-tauri/crates/onecad-library/src/tables.rs,
             worker/src/ops/ComponentOp.cpp::iso4762Table())

Source:     BOLTS — Open Library of Technical Specifications
            https://github.com/boltsparts/BOLTS_archive
            data/hex_socket.blt, class "hexsocketheadcap"

Author:     Johannes Reinhardt <jreinhardt@ist-dein-freund.de>

License:    GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
            (LGPL-2.1+), per the file's own header. Full text:
            https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-2.1.html

Retrieved:  2026-08-12

Notes:      Dimension values (M2–M12) transcribed into two independent,
            purpose-specific representations — a Rust metadata table
            (onecad-library::tables::Iso4762Table) and a C++ worker
            generator table (ComponentOp.cpp::iso4762Table()) — per this
            project's architecture (generators are built-in/versioned in
            the worker; the library crate serves authoring/metadata, not
            geometry). Neither copy embeds BOLTS source code, only the
            published dimension data. The repository's GitHub-reported
            top-level license (GPL-3.0) is a whole-repo default; the
            specific data file used here carries its own LGPL 2.1+ header,
            which is the license that applies to this data.
